        "id": "EkkoQ",
        "name": "Timewinder",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Ekko throws a temporal grenade that expands into a time-distortion field upon hitting an enemy champion, slowing and damaging anyone caught inside. After a delay, the grenade rewinds back to Ekko, dealing damage on its return.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ekko throws a device dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/95/110/125/140 + (30% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>. On hitting a champion or reaching the end of its range, it expands into a field that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slows</span> enemies inside by 40/45/50/55/60%. After it expands, Ekko recalls it, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(40/65/90/115/140 + (60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.",
