      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "EkkoR",
        "name": "Chronobreak",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Ekko shatters his timeline, becoming untargetable and rewinding to a more favorable point in time. He returns to whenever he was a few seconds ago, and heals for a percentage of the damage received in that duration. Enemies near his arrival zone take massive damage.",
        "bodyHtml": "Ekko turns back time, entering Stasis while teleporting to where he was 4 seconds ago and dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(200/350/500 + (175% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> to nearby enemies. In addition, Ekko restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(100/150/200 + (60% Ability Power)) Health</span>, increased by 3% for each 1% Health he lost in last 4 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Will detonate the chronosphere from Parallel Convergence [?] if Ekko passed through it.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Units in Stasis cannot move or act, and are Invulnerable and Untargetable.</span>",
